<h1 align="center">Hey there ! 👋 I'm {{ profile.name }}</h1>

<p align="center">
  <em>{{ lang.bio }}</em>
</p>

<p align="center">
  {% if profile.location %}
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Location-{{ profile.location|url_encode }}-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=googlemaps&logoColor=white" alt="{{ profile.location }}"/>
  {% endif %}
  {% for social in socials %}
  <a href="{{ social.url }}"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/{{ social.label }}-{{ social.color }}?style=for-the-badge&logo={{ social.icon }}&logoColor=white" alt="{{ social.label }}"/></a>
  {% endfor %}
  <a href="https://ktherage.github.io/"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Blog-EN-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=googlechrome&logoColor=white" alt="Blog EN"/></a>
  <a href="https://ktherage.github.io/fr/"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Blog-FR-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=googlechrome&logoColor=white" alt="Blog FR"/></a>
</p>

---

## 🧑‍💻 About Me

- 🔭 I'm currently working on **{{ profile.company }}**
- 🌱 I'm currently learning **{{ lang.learning|join(', ') }}**
- 💬 Ask me about **{{ lang.ask_me_about|join(', ') }}**
- ⚡ Fun fact: *{{ lang.fun_fact }}*

