## 🛠️ Tech Stack

<p align="center">
  {% for lang in languages %}
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/{{ lang.name }}-{{ lang.color }}?style=for-the-badge&logo={{ lang.name|lower }}&logoColor=white" alt="{{ lang.name }}"/>
  {% endfor %}
</p>

